memorymap
title: nRF52840 memory map
meta: BLE SoC — Code FLASH, UICR, RAM, APB, FICR, PPB
cols: 24
[0x00000000-0x00000FFF] MBR @fixed role=boot
[0x00001000-0x00025FFF] SoftDevice @note role=sd
[0x00026000-0x000F5FFF] Application @data role=app
[0x000F6000-0x000FDFFF] OTA slot A @accent role=ota
[0x000FE000-0x000FFFFF] Boot settings @warn role=cfg
[0x10001000-0x100013FF] FICR @data role=ficr
[0x10080000-0x10080FFF] UICR @data role=uicr
[0x20000000-0x2003FFFF] SRAM 256KiB @accent role=ram
[0x40000000-0x400FFFFF] APB peripherals @note role=mmio
[0x50000000-0x50000FFF] GPIO @warn role=gpio
[0xE0000000-0xE00FFFFF] PPB @error role=sys
